{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_tmMSxUJxKCxSqKAKdtIow","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:23.340062+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_tmMSxUJxKCxSqKAKdtIow","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为增进高校学生对29所研究生选拔、培养和支持政策的了解，促进电子信息领域优秀学生的交流，29所将于2025年8月5日-7日举办大学生夏令营活动，诚邀广大优秀学子踊跃报名。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>单位介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>中国电子科技集团公司第二十九研究所（简称“29所”）成立于1965年，位于四川省成都市，是我国第一个专业从事电子信息控制总体技术研究、装备型号研制与生产的骨干研究所。经过60年的发展，29所凝聚了一支高质量人才队伍，共有院士1人、国家级人才80余人、省部级人才400余人。29所具有一流的“研发创新、核心制造、测试评估、服务保障”等能力；主要装备代表行业领先水平，荣获各类科技成果千余项。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学位点介绍</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>经过20多年的研究生自主培养，29所已形成了完善的培养体系：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>◆学位点：</span></strong><span>3个一级学科硕士点（电子科学与技术、信息与通信工程、计算机科学与技术），1个二级学科博士点（通信与信息系统）。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>◆培养模式：</span></strong><span>硕士采用“1+2”培养模式，第一年在高校开展基础理论课学习，第二、三年入所开展科研实践和毕业设计，第三年可申请硕博连读。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>◆支持政策：</span></strong><span>读研期间免学费，并提供生活补助、科研津贴、免费住宿，购买工伤保险、意外险。对推免生提供入学奖学金，并优先配备以首席科学家、首席专家、行业总师为首的高水平导师队伍。科研实践期间，参与国家重点项目，提供工程研究的先进科研设备与试验条件。毕业后，按照校园招聘流程，可定向留所工作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营相关事宜</span></strong><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请条件</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJk6upibhAIGg05cjgdyI0KcLssFbBVVFYP0mBwcich2gk4gMeMT1GtErQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、全国普通高校本科2022级在校生（2026年7月毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2、达到所在学校推荐免试生要求且有意申请我所推荐免试硕士研究生；</span></p><p><span>3、本科专业为电子信息类、计算类、自动化及控制类等相关专业，对所报专业有浓厚的兴趣，愿意从事科研学术研究；</span></p><p><span>4、英语水平良好。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请材料</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJk6upibhAIGg05cjgdyI0KcLssFbBVVFYP0mBwcich2gk4gMeMT1GtErQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、学生证、身份证复印件；</span></p><p><span>2、29所夏令营申请表；</span></p><p><span>3、英语等级证书；</span></p><p><span>4、本科阶段前五个学期成绩单，须由院系教务部门盖章并扫描；</span></p><p><span>5、其他体现学习和科研能力的相关材料。（如大学英语四、六级证书、已发表学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果、各类获奖或资格证书等）</span></p><p><strong><span>7月30日前，按照“姓名—申请专业—本科院校”命名规则将申请材料压缩包发至邮箱。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>资格审查</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJk6upibhAIGg05cjgdyI0KcLssFbBVVFYP0mBwcich2gk4gMeMT1GtErQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>对申请者提交的电子材料进行资格审核，并将通过邮件、电话等方式告知审核结果。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>日程</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJk6upibhAIGg05cjgdyI0KcLssFbBVVFYP0mBwcich2gk4gMeMT1GtErQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJkibtxhvGP2jrsPibenSIA9a8WicRuiaEdvWQzrl9T47QnW8Paox2wtftrTQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>其他事宜</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJk6upibhAIGg05cjgdyI0KcLssFbBVVFYP0mBwcich2gk4gMeMT1GtErQA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、在营期间，统一安排食宿；</span></p><p><span>2、按规定报销往返车票。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qnrZUtdHp453zx2yWj0tfRmVtskrznJkfdUicLhfCmOgFV3Z9M10M5K2p6MEnNX8LLp0saFicKnYT27p8ZnibHVXg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>联系电话：028-87550583</span></p><p><span>邮箱：swieepx@163.com</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>供稿 人力资源部</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"52d4fd6f3e6334e5e512efd73e27e895e1b451524d83a3af131054a3a3fc1071","textLength":1013,"sourceSha256":"121e52318fbbb91ea7c7a57fa822a3afda7fe0c96102c8a0a27932610ff3f57d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6720318f5da16a20284a","title":"2025年中国电子科技集团公司第二十九研究所2025年优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:23.340062+00:00"}
